libmsiecf
------------------------------------------
libmsiecf is a library to access the Microsoft Internet Explorer (MSIE) Cache
File (index.dat) files.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue1-20260531-1bl1
  libmsiecf-devel-20260525-1bl1
  libmsiecf1-20260525-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfole-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue-devel-20260531-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libmsiecf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libmsiecf/archive/refs/tags/20260525.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmsiecf-20260525-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmsiecf-20260525-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmsiecf-20260525-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmsiecf-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmsiecf1-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmsiecf-devel-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libmsiecf-20260525-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libmsiecf)
  /usr/bin/msiecfexport.exe
  /usr/bin/msiecfinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libmsiecf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libmsiecf/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libmsiecf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libmsiecf/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libmsiecf/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libmsiecf/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/msiecfexport.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/msiecfinfo.1.gz

(libmsiecf1)
  /usr/bin/cygmsiecf-1.dll

(libmsiecf-devel)
  /usr/include/libmsiecf.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/error.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/extern.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/features.h
  /usr/include/libmsiecf/types.h
  /usr/lib/libmsiecf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libmsiecf.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libmsiecf.3.gz

(python312-libmsiecf)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pymsiecf.dll

